        {
          "pattern": "\\.GroupBy\\(",
          "message": "Groups endpoints with GroupBy"
        },
        {
          "pattern": "\\.Take\\(",
          "message": "Limits the list with Take"
        }
      ],
      "hints": [
        "`entries.CountBy(e => e.Status).OrderBy(p => p.Key)` and deconstruct each pair with `var (status, count)`.",
        "`entries.GroupBy(e => e.Endpoint).Select(g => new { Endpoint = g.Key, Hits = g.Count() })`",
        "Then `.OrderByDescending(x => x.Hits).ThenBy(x => x.Endpoint).Take(3)`."
      ]
